  "description": "FIZCUO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C112 H132 Cl2 N8 O18 Yb4 2+,2(Cl1 1-),4(C2 H6 O1),6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb1B (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2B (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.438-3.795 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.10-110.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(L)2(HL)2Cl2(μ3-OH)2]·2Cl·4EtOH·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
